  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/em_banner.gif\" width=\"1004\" height=\"502\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://discord.gg/nFBAXfb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=5865f2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://github.com/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=000000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=FF0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iglee42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=f16436&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252figlee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=1ace65&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:30px\"><span style=\"color:#808080;font-size:30px\">Evolved Mekanism 透過新增機器階層與額外內容來強化 Mekanism<br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">目前支援的 Mekanism 版本：<br>1.20.1：10.4<br>1.21.1：10.7</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">5 種新的機器階層：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#00da00\"><strong>超頻</strong> </span>（11 格）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_012f4fec-64f0-4636-b96e-761e94528c92.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_7f022760-6736-45d5-9cdb-883000465b16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"446\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>量子</strong></span>（13 格）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_d0da1937-02df-4bdc-8981-da53966af249.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"204\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ec6cd516-1e1e-409f-850b-1933edfca972.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"522\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>緻密</strong></span>（15 格）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_1686b2b2-1178-4e82-aaab-056a9facac26.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_2debccdc-f85b-4910-b7d7-03421a0aaf8a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#202020\"><strong>多元宇宙</strong></span>（17 格）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0c13c489-817e-471a-acf2-b5f9fc285c10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_74b230a5-630b-4e28-b26a-4ddf3a88612b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"674\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>創造</strong></span>（19 格）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_aacb5ed6-127c-4bc6-89bb-c09b44764190.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">（模組包製作者，現在是你們為創造合金設計合成配方的時候了）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_465907dc-33b0-4522-9033-5356c0b8e0bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"332\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>新增的其他內容</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">階層安裝器 | 合金 | 電路 | 儲存箱 | 感應 | 儲罐 | 單元 | 機器階層 | QIO</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_569ba91d-e4f3-4c4b-9540-64c32d29c98f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"200\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">進階個人儲物箱與儲物桶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_8d01c606-6c45-4b0e-b786-ae55a736e87d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"344\" height=\"92\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">合金方塊</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_46c78c72-b991-43ff-a5fd-0955cbed9d06.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">纜線</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_3aa25158-1a9a-4165-b4bb-7719ec52f027.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">精煉紅石</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_2be91858-7ce5-4b16-98c7-ce766d40e9aa.png\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>新增的機器</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>反物質原分子轉換器</strong>（<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">APT</span>）&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_573d6a3f-379b-4d35-a057-29d6fd270df1.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">它<strong> </strong>用於合成第 7 階層</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0d952523-de7d-4ee4-90b4-ccd238c05d1a.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">以下是建造指南：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_df9bbae4-1af8-46cf-851a-0066c6fa489b.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">APT</span> 的合成速度可透過 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">超載元件</span> 提升</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ec913e27-2829-4ed4-b237-4a2e3afa65b7.png\" width=\"186\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p>你可以在 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">APT</span> 底部（第二層）放置最多 25 個以達到高速合成</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_270be1b8-16bf-42cd-a977-d374a03aba02.png\" width=\"263\" height=\"263\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\">合金爐&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\">可結合 3 種物品</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_da8de736-fe5b-4e7f-b0f9-0021e380d9ff.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"331\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">它與部分模組相容：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Applied Energistics 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_78123c99-80a9-4835-ab41-2121777d219f.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Ender IO</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0adc7b4c-e4dd-4a72-b3a2-69af644021fb.png\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Thermal 與 Thermal Endergy</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0719ee01-7e0b-4b63-8786-450be4c1c48a.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>化學混合器</strong> 可結合 2 種物品與 1 種氣體</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_29cfdb18-2494-4e30-81c1-bb4bcd5d7d3b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"331\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">它用於合成第 8 階層</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_7735c050-1024-49ee-8cd5-faa24a6a138d.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>熔融流體系統</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>熱熔器</strong> 可將材料熔化成其熔融流體版本</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_171fc9eb-4225-47e4-a6e6-26cbf3fc10c2.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"332\"></span></p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">利用電阻加熱器產生的熱量來熔化</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_2bcbba76-e9be-45d2-94a0-5ea3decd5d57.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>固化室</strong>可將熔融流體固化為其材料版本</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_03cfa41e-a021-4db7-b905-18cbd56c9baa.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"328\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">使用液態氧進行固化</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_8afdd98e-ebc8-464c-99dc-fc6cdef56b4f.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">固化室使用的模具列表（製作時不會消耗）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_fb0dcb85-3ccd-4715-9125-685e45001449.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>方塊模具 | 錠模具 | 寶石模具 | 粒模具 | 粉塵模具</li>\n<li>板模具 | 齒輪模具 | 桿模具 | 線模具 | 硬幣模具</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>進化太陽能板</strong>（Mekanism Generators 兼容性）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_b47f9917-d095-431e-b95e-934ccb8af011.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"181\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_f728c5fb-4677-4aa9-b044-d333cee06742.png\" width=\"699\" height=\"180\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>物品與工具（Mekanism Tools 兼容性）</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">更好的黃金物品與工具</span></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_a6784663-e92a-40e7-99ff-727e0f149d4e.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"213\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_bfd78854-1843-46f9-93b1-a0fd430a9c54.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">電漿石物品與工具</span></p>\n<br>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ed3f2e0a-9e75-484e-87aa-8b3a161b999a.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"210\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ce54b628-dc5a-410f-83e2-39d1c6b935fc.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">精煉紅石物品與工具</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_39941322-91e0-46f8-ad56-884f4f1039f7.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"203\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_8c63853f-2994-4ae1-aa9a-f5f26ab11408.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>其他新增內容</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>模組單元</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0dc1560c-ed98-4c52-b4a2-9e59abd550d7.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>空氣親和單元：飛行時禁用挖掘懲罰。（支援 MekaSuit 靴子）</li>\n<li>水下親和單元：水下時禁用挖掘懲罰。（支援 MekaSuit 頭盔）</li>\n<li>捕捉單元：擊殺生物時有機率掉落其生成蛋。（支援 Meka-Tool）</li>\n<li>幸運單元：提高獲得更好戰利品的機率。（支援 MekaSuit 護腿）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>升級組件</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ed88c067-2fab-432f-840f-64cb18f598a5.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>放射性升級：允許注入放射性氣體。（用於化學混合器）</li>\n<li>太陽能升級：提高發電機的太陽能產量。（用於太陽能發電機）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>跨維度 Mekanism 礦石</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_f2dbf470-44f6-4765-b3a4-97d9cdd972a1.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"352\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>兼容 Aether 與 Undergarden 維度</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>計劃中的功能</strong>：</span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>流體合金機</li>\n<li>月球發電機</li>\n<li>彩色機器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以及大量後續將會推出的物品與創意...</p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829380/description_351e5b5a-1c0d-493f-bb82-932420236878.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">您可以在自己的模組包中使用此模組，但不得在其他網站重新發布！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Curseforge 與 Modrinth 是唯二發布此模組的網站</span></p>\n</div>",
